            <ArticleTitle>Recommendations on practice of conditioned pain modulation (CPM) testing.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>805-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/ejp.605</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Protocols for testing conditioned pain modulation (CPM) vary between different labs/clinics. In order to promote research and clinical application of this tool, we summarize the recommendations of interested researchers consensus meeting regarding the practice of CPM and report of its results.</AbstractText>
                <CopyrightInformation>© 2014 European Pain Federation - EFIC®</CopyrightInformation>
            </Abstract>
